 "id": "25225915633677687", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308046_25225915640344353_6092902389894417707_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gmhr_5e9k2sQ7kNvwHb16Ot&_nc_oc=Adr1H8nqD19yW0sbsgoLJojad50WAWTlafT0bVb4a23L3IxWxROolJXSfuAyqBi31MA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMaBBGoLDQfptSCzzeV1QL3iUfFaCuUCMFK4Rzl2VdXvg&oe=6AE49F44"}, {"file_name": "\u6e38\u620f\u622a\u56fe03.png", "id": "1946976459471211", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294603_1946976462804544_3250448151843517596_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eflxxSySwwQQ7kNvwHewZfT&_nc_oc=Adp2j6xkhfvR8lNp9_Q1x_gF4CtycnpQzWVduVtIoRDk7c6GdqjWxCsyLsKEFjFHfDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOWias5zOT5ff2TxHLlXoCIxMRB98vadfFx6c8Im7Ru8A&oe=6AE49E00"}, {"file_name": "\u6e38\u620f\u622a\u56fe04.png", "id": "3652379685058357", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_3652379688391690_165257228393752486_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bkhGekimVsMQ7kNvwHyuc3z&_nc_oc=AdqXYLoSrX6sJn_JXncOYu5NOy0rJKjt2U_87AT847FPkgd9Lek_tZnuwGfMKCAsAh4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN2eS1bqs3H426-5tLnuk0VPU9c1sghikQlDbc1vdxOMA&oe=6AE4949D"}, {"file_name": "\u6e38\u620f\u622a\u56fe05.png", "id": "1405617150505614", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618240_1405617153838947_5397922396538077958_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4-wzX0iJP9YQ7kNvwGGNXSm&_nc_oc=Adq_DnnwAAthyujDGXnKtUvntG5lifYH70HlDGMsx02qGz9lxwDSJeKjl8Rp_JdLd6Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPfejrjGtn5CjgZ_nm9IipKLl4zPxPKaKdSSNv5SaBO-g&oe=6AE4BBED"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Balcony Garden", "keywords": ["balcony", "garden", "grow", "flower", "plant"], "long_description": "a cozy, stylized gardening game set on a peaceful balcony. It\u2019s all about growing beautiful plants, relaxing, and enjoying a slow-paced, soothing experience  \n# Features:  \n**\ud83c\udf3c Grow over 80 different types of plants, including flowers, aquatic plants, fruits, and vegetables \u2014 with a main focus on flowers**  \n  \n**\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Discover rare, beautiful, and uniquely shaped plants from across all seven continents, these plants are inspired by real-world botanical wonders \u2014 strange, exotic, and visually stunning**  \n  \n**\ud83d\udca6 Water, fertilize, and weed your garden, each action influences how your plants grow and thrive**  \n  \n**\ud83c\udf27\ufe0fEnjoy a dynamic weather system rain, sunshine, clouds, and more \u2014 changing the mood and visuals of your garden**  \n  \n**\ud83e\uddd8 No grinding, no clutter \u2014 just pure gardening and chill vibes, you only need to buy seeds; everything else flows naturally**\n  \n**\ud83c\udf19 Go to sleep, then watch your plants grow, time moves gently \u2014 and every morning brings surprises**  \n  \n**\ud83d\udc3f\ufe0f Interact with small animal visitors from squirrels to birds, you can feed them, play with them, and enjoy their company.**", "short_description": "growing beautiful plants, relaxing, and enjoying a slow-paced, soothing experience"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/ShiSuoGameStudio/LMagicRealityStudioPrivacyPolicy/blob/main/LMagic%20Reality%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LMagic Reality Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.lmagicreality.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_